<mxCell id="inv_note" value="INVARIANT S-01 (CRITICAL): SQLValidator.validate() runs INSIDE the SQL repair loop before EVERY execution attempt. Security violations -&gt; IMMEDIATE HALT, no retry. NEVER MOVE THIS." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#b71c1c;fillColor=#ffcdd2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=3;fontColor=#7f0000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="1050" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="val_note" value="9-Layer Validation Pipeline: L1 Security (AST) -&gt; L2 SQL Syntax -&gt; L3 Semantic -&gt; L4 Intent-Align -&gt; L5 Join+Cardinality -&gt; L6 Result-Shape -&gt; L7 Statistical -&gt; L8 Evidence -&gt; L9 Reproducibility" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#ad1457;fillColor=#ffebee;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#880e4f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="1098" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
